Groton -> Middlesex[label="19.5 (23.4)
05/16", weight="81", tooltip="NEIRA Boys Fours, Middlesex at Groton			
Distance: 1250 m. Conditions: Flat glassy water. Perhaps more helping current as the races went on.
Race order 4-2-1-3 Comments: It was a beautiful day to be out on the water. The races all started right on the starting line. It was good to get Middlesex back on the schedule after a few years when we could not find a date.
Thanks for the racing, Middlesex.
