Nobles -> Hotchkiss[label="22.5 (24.11)
05/09", weight="78", tooltip="NEIRA Boys & Girls Fours,NEIRA Boys and Girls Fours: NMH, Hotchkiss, and Nobles			
Distance: 1400m Conditions: Rain throughout the day, but it picked up intensity after the B3 race. Little to no wind throughout the day. Racing order was B5/G1/B1/G2/B2/G3/B3/G4/B4/G5/CoedJV8's. Moderate/strong current that was even across the lanes. In the B1 race, there was a photo finish between NMH and Hotchkiss; Hotchkiss beat NMH by about a bow ball. Another photo finish in the B3 race, where Hotchkiss beat NMH by 0.4. Thank you to Hotchkiss and Nobles for making the trip!
